{
  "version": 2,
  "engine": "va",
  "name": "va_cold_tape_pad",
  "description": "Cold worn-tape pad: two saws behind a dark low-pass, very slow swell, and a strong slow pitch warble of the whole voice plus two desynchronized beating layers (warped cassette ambient); a 40 s LFO slowly opens and closes the filter.",
